pattern B
lead    | C5----- D5- F5--- | E5------- C5--- | G5----- F5- E5--- | C5----------- |
lead    | D5----- E5- F5--- | G5------- Bb5--- | A5----- G5- F5--- | E5------- .--- |
bird    | _ | _ | _ | .----- G6 C6+D6---- |
bird    | _ | _ | _ | .------- A6 A5+B5-- |
